# At cleanup the EOT command returns the Sword to the AI; the delayed
# trigger's IsPresent$ (Card.IsTriggerRemembered+AttachedTo Creature.YouCtrl)
# holds, since the Sword is still on the human's Bears as control changes, so
# Unattach resolves and the Sword ends loose on the AI's side.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
queue targets 3
queue targets 4
castspell human 1
resolvestack
advance 9
resolvestack
